WEBVTT

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.800
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.080
You are my sun now

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.500
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.510
no matter who you are

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:36.930
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:45.640
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:51.030
is clear again

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.410
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:59.910
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:05.250
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:08.920
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:16.760
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:23.560
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:30.940
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:38.280
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.800
<i>While searching for the king's heir,</i>

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:03.800
<i>Lief and his party journeyed to Withick Mire
to reach an agreement with all seven tribes.</i>

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:08.300
<i>The representatives of the seven
tribes had finally gathered.</i>

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:13.320
<i>Unexpectedly, they were attacked by
the Carn Unit during the meeting.</i>

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.500
<i>In the midst of battle, Glock saved Jasmine's life,</i>

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:21.520
<i>and as a result, the two finally became friends.</i>

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:25.200
<i>Now, before the Belt of Deltora,</i>

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.600
<i>the seven tribes can finally begin their ceremony.</i>

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:49.700
I hope Barda's injuries are getting better...

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.200
Thanks.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:55.000
Don't worry so much.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:57.300
That medicine will work,

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:00.500
especially on a straightforward guy like him.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.480
Thank you, Glock.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:07.300
Well, who's to say Barda's really that kind of guy.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:11.100
You really can't let that bad
attitude go, can you?

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.100
Like you're any different yourself!

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:19.330
My, they're getting along well.

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:23.300
Either way, it makes me happy
to see them both laughing.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:30.700
Really, I never would have expected to see you
two getting along so well; it's almost shocking.

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:34.700
Here's hoping all of your good luck hasn't
run out and you don't have a mishap.

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:36.100
Shut your mouth, Jinx!

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:37.300
My thoughts exactly!

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.600
I wonder which one of us needs to shut up.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:42.900
Glock!

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:44.800
Hold on, wait a minute!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.100
Glock.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:49.600
Please forgive him.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.400
We will soon begin the oath ceremony,

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:58.830
and we must wait for the arrival of the king's heir who will save Deltora.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:04.960
That was close.

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:12.220
There, that should do it.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.500
Sorry for this, Dain.

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:19.300
Don't be, it's not a problem at all.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:22.100
I must say, you're quite practiced with this, Dain.

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:23.200
Not really...

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:26.500
I'm just happy to do what little I can to help.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:27.900
A little?

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:31.350
You're an irreplaceable friend to us.

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:32.600
Thank you.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:33.800
At any rate,

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:38.320
the fact that the Carn Unit
attacked us here is a problem.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.600
I'm concerned about that as well.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:46.000
But, Glock has opened up to us now,

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:51.100
and I don't want to even imagine there
being a spy of the Shadow Lord in our midst.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.600
I feel the same way.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:56.700
But it's better to be safe than
sorry in this situation.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:57.900
Yeah.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:03.000
Either way, we should focus
on the ceremony for now.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.500
Maybe things will become more clear after that.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.200
Yeah, you're right.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.810
I agree, Lief.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.780
Let's go and join the rest.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:14.500
They're taking a while...

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.400
Sorry for keeping you waiting.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:21.800
Welcome back.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:24.000
I'm glad to see you're well.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.600
We were worried about you.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.870
Barda, how are you feeling?

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:32.890
I feel great. I was saved, thanks to that medicine.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:38.100
Looks like Barda really is a straightforward guy.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:41.700
It really is all thanks to you. Thank you, Glock!

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:43.300
Thank you.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:44.900
Alright then!

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.800
There's no time to waste.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:50.800
Let's get this ceremony thing started right away!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.000
Yes, we should.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.000
Yeah!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:07.160
We will now start the oath
ceremony of the seven tribes.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.170
To begin, bring forth the Belt of Deltora.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.380
Come, Lief.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.500
Right.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:29.270
Look at that; it's incredible! It's full of gems!

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:40.280
There is a passage in 'The Belt of Deltora'.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:44.400
<i>The seven gems, each with their own power.</i>

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:51.000
<i>When they truly come together as one,
they will unleash an even greater power.</i>

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:57.000
In short, if the seven tribes
work together and unite,

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:00.700
the heir who will save Deltora will appear.

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:03.800
You sound quite sure of yourself.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:07.500
But do you even know where
this heir is going to come from?

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:10.200
That's a good point...

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:12.020
I believe it!

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:14.800
I believe Lief.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:19.900
He and his companions have been through
such hardship up until this point.

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:21.900
You should all know this by now.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.800
While the gems are beautiful,

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:28.000
they had to be obtained through great adversity.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:31.540
But even so, they didn't give up.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:35.040
It's all thanks to Lief, Barda and Jasmine.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.800
We have everyone else to thank as well.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:38.900
That's right.

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:39.900
Dain.

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:41.170
Thank you.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.680
I believe a miracle is sure to come!

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:47.500
I would love to believe that myself.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:53.770
I will not forgive them.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:58.070
Those three took something precious from me.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.950
I will never forgive them!

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:21.300
With this, we shall now conduct the oath ceremony
with the representatives of the seven tribes.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:26.500
When the name of the representative is called, I ask them to stand before the Belt.

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.600
Representative of the Plains tribe, Steven.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:34.700
Yes.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.780
Place your hand upon the Belt.

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:43.400
Right.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:47.280
Please, lend us your strength.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.700
Representative of the Ralad tribe, Manus.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:58.750
Yes.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:05.260
I've waited a long time for this day to come.

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:08.260
The Ralad tribe places its trust...

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.400
in the strength of the ruby.

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:14.600
Representative of the Toran tribe,

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:15.700
Zeean.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:18.300
Yes.

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:26.280
Please lend us your power, amethyst.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:33.290
Representative of the Jalis tribe, Glock.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:45.550
Hey, don't tell me you're scared, are you?

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:48.880
That's not it!

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:54.400
My people were all killed by the Shadow Lord...

00:09:54.600 --> 00:10:00.200
And to think that someone as reckless
as me is the only survivor...

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:04.820
Glock...

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:06.900
Glock!

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:06.900
Glock!

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.790
I will never forgive the Shadow Lord!

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:24.040
Representative of the
Dread Gnome tribe, Gla-Thon.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.050
Yes.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:28.700
You can do it, Gla-Thon!

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:32.700
Emerald, please grant me power!

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.500
Representative of the Mere tribe,

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:39.900
Fardeep.

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.500
Yes.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.950
Lapis lazuli,

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:51.990
grant us protection.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:58.500
Representative of the Del tribe, Lief.

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:00.750
Yes.

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.500
Mother,

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.700
Father,

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:10.800
Barda,

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:14.260
along with all the people of Del.

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:16.260
Please watch.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.700
<i>It's not getting hot.</i>

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.300
<i>But,</i>

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:33.660
<i>the heir will appear.</i>

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:37.050
<i>A miracle will surely occur.</i>

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:43.000
Now, the representatives shall
declare their oaths to the Belt.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.500
We, the representatives of the seven tribes,

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:50.800
hereby renew our old oaths upon this belt,

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:59.060
to unite and swear our fealty to the descendants of the first king, Adin.

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:00.770
I swear.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:02.390
I swear.

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:04.060
I swear.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.690
I swear.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:07.400
I swear.

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.400
I swear.

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:16.910
<i>Will a miracle really occur?</i>

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:35.900
Oh seven gems,

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:36.720
Belt,

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.640
please answer us.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:40.640
Where is the heir?

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:00.000
My heart feels clear,

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.660
and it's warming up!

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:04.500
Oh my!

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:07.170
The amethyst has grown warm!

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.900
The emerald as well.

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:11.400
And the ruby.

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:14.300
I can feel the same with the lapis lazuli...

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:16.000
It's the same with the opal!

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:22.600
He's here, in this very room.

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.730
King Endon's child.

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:35.000
The heat of the Belt must be from
the heir being here in this room.

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:37.990
That heir is...

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:40.300
Dain!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:47.250
The name of the first king was Adin.

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:53.100
There's no doubt that the name 'Dain' is a
rearrangement of the letters of Adin's name.

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:59.400
Dain was born and raised somewhere
here, far from civilisation,

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:06.220
and his parents taught him the history of his country with 'The Belt of Deltora'.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:12.700
His strong sense of responsibility
must have come from King Endon.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:21.160
And his gentle and quiet personality must
be from his Toran mother, Queen Sharn!

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:23.200
Dain,

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:27.000
what did you mother call herself?

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.250
Huh...?

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:30.500
Her name.

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:34.100
It was Rhans...

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:35.700
Why do you ask?

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:37.300
Rhans...

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:39.400
I see!

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.970
Sharn and Rhans!

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:47.600
So his mother hid her name that way?

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.100
Dain...

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:52.500
Lief!

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:54.730
Lief...

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:57.000
Lief.

00:14:57.400 --> 00:14:58.700
Are you alright?

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:00.500
I am.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.200
Of course I am,

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:03.300
Jasmine.

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:06.620
I've never been so happy.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:16.200
Dain.

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:20.880
You've done well to survive all
the way up until this point.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:26.500
This very moment is what
we've all been fighting for.

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:32.800
To find a descendant of King Adin,
and to bestow this belt upon him.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:37.940
Now, let's give the Belt to Dain!

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:43.100
We will now bestow the Belt of Deltora to Dain,

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:45.800
the successor to the throne of Deltora.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:51.200
So you're the king's heir... Dain.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:56.400
Young Dain...!

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:59.920
Come, Lief. Give him the Belt of Deltora.

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:01.500
Right!

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:12.600
The Belt is reacting...!

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:14.940
<i>The ruby's colour is fading...</i>

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.440
<i>The emerald too...!</i>

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:20.200
<i>Could this mean...</i>

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:22.900
<i>danger is closing in?</i>

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:26.300
Lief...?

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:31.200
Be careful. An enemy is close by!

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:35.790
Get down! Something is coming!

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.200
I won't forgive you...

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:45.400
Everyone get out! Quick!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.800
Every single one of you...

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.200
is utterly unforgivable...!

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.100
Ichabod!

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:53.500
You're alive?!

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:55.890
The Belt...!

00:16:58.600 --> 00:16:59.600
Lief!

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:06.500
Lief!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.500
Damn you...!

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:15.830
You all took something precious to me.

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:34.500
So I will also take something precious...

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:35.980
from you.

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.810
I will take him...!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:46.740
Run, Dain!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:53.100
Feel the weight of my grief!

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:01.830
Dain!

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.340
Lief...

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:17.700
Dain!!

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:38.100
What's the matter?

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:40.600
Is something over there?

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.540
This is...!

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.700
It's Dain's blade!

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:55.400
God damn it...! Why couldn't I protect him?!

00:18:55.400 --> 00:19:00.000
Even after protecting his life
had become my sole duty...!

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:05.300
Why has it come to this...?

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:10.700
What the hell <i>was</i> that monster?

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:14.450
The only remaining child of Sorceress
Thaegan's thirteen children.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:19.900
The last of them, and the
most fearsome one of all.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:21.960
Ichabod.

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:26.960
Ichabod... What a terrifying monster.

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:30.300
There was nothing I could do against him...

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:32.470
Me neither.

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:37.100
So information on our whereabouts
really is being leaked.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:40.200
Who is it?! Which one of you is selling us out?!

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:43.900
Who is it?!

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:46.900
This is not the time to be yelling such things!

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:52.200
Are you incapable of trusting your friends?

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.700
Exactly.

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:56.700
Especially considering we've only just united...

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:58.500
What did you just say?!

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.290
Sorry...

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.600
They're right.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.700
Rather than suspecting one another,

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:09.700
we should be searching for Ichabod.

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:13.800
Hey now, are you really going to
go after that monster?

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:15.600
Jinx...

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:17.300
This doesn't concern you.

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:20.400
Don't be so cold, Barda.

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:24.520
You don't <i>really</i> think Dain is still alive, do you?

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:27.800
He's been taken by that monster!

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:30.020
Come on, don't you get it?

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:32.400
There's no way he's still alive!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.400
Jinx!

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:38.280
You... Where have you been up 'til now?

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:41.250
I was hiding, of course!

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:44.200
I have no interest in being killed by that monster.

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.500
What?!

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:49.400
That's enough, Jinx.
You can't stay here any longer.

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:50.400
Huh?

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:53.260
Doom, I'm just kidding!

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:56.200
Regardless of whether you're a spy or not,

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:59.200
we have no need for people who
can't protect their comrades.

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:02.300
Ha! What a great bunch you Resistance lot are!

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:13.400
<i>Even though we had finally come this far...</i>

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:16.400
<i>Even though the real fight
was just about to begin...</i>

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:20.740
<i>Our most important friend and
asset was taken from us.</i>

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:25.600
<i>Our way forward; our hope that we had found,</i>

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:27.400
<i>is now gone.</i>

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:39.800
Hey...

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:44.900
Do you think Ichabod kidnapped Dain
under the Shadow Lord's orders?

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:46.200
Most likely.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:51.270
And if it is true, Dain would
have been taken to Del Palace.

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:55.280
The problem now is what to do next.

00:21:58.900 --> 00:22:00.600
We take Dain back!

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:04.600
I've been waiting for you to say that!

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:06.100
I will lend a hand.

00:22:06.100 --> 00:22:09.700
If it's for Young Dain,
there's nothing I wouldn't do!

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:12.170
We will help as well.

00:22:12.400 --> 00:22:15.000
Ask anything of me.

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:17.100
I will also help!

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:19.400
The same goes for myself.

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:21.200
It looks like it's decided, then.

00:22:21.200 --> 00:22:22.140
Yeah!

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:25.600
Dain.

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:27.900
We will save you, no matter what!

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:53.430
I would be lying to you

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:59.230
if I said I wasn't lonely

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:05.770
I know I'm not being honest

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:11.570
but I just can't put it into words

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:18.540
It's for the sake of our dreams

00:23:20.210 --> 00:23:22.120
At this point

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:27.800
to sing "I love you" to a faraway you

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:34.090
my voice would simply fade into the wind

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:40.430
In a way, that's worse than saying "goodbye"

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:47.520
But someday our dreams will bloom

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:55.870
Dreams X Dreams

00:24:06.200 --> 00:24:08.600
The Seven Gems - the Opal.

00:24:09.600 --> 00:24:13.600
<i>The third gem, found in the City of the Rats
and belonging to the Plains tribe.</i>

00:24:13.600 --> 00:24:16.450
<i>It bestows hope and reveals the future.</i>

00:24:16.450 --> 00:24:19.920
<i>It shares a special affinity with the lapis lazuli.</i>

00:24:21.200 --> 00:24:26.100
We are all heading to Del Palace
in order to save Dain.

00:24:26.400 --> 00:24:29.900
Then, a man we had thought
to be defeated reappears.

00:24:30.940 --> 00:24:34.860
Orcus' Last Stand

00:24:31.100 --> 00:24:34.860
Next time, 'Orcus' Last Stand'.

00:24:49.900 --> 00:24:54.970
See you next time
